{"3852180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexateria", "steam_appid": 3852180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a different set of skills. Each completed mission grants you new abilities to deploy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat against overwhelming numbers of Bunglings (enemies) allows for a variety of tactics. Friendly fire, magic potions, and interactive board elements add variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire action is set in a unique fantasy world, with stylized stop-motion animation and a story with a sense of humor. As the Meat Company Commander, how many veterans will you sacrifice to complete the mission? Or are you good enough to ensure everyone survives?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a different set of skills. Each completed mission grants you new abilities to deploy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat against overwhelming numbers of Bunglings (enemies) allows for a variety of tactics. Friendly fire, magic potions, and interactive board elements add variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire action is set in a unique fantasy world, with stylized stop-motion animation and a story with a sense of humor. As the Meat Company Commander, how many veterans will you sacrifice to complete the mission? Or are you good enough to ensure everyone survives?</p>", "short_description": "A fantasy world handcrafted before it became a game. A turn-based game where every hero and every enemy was first created as real cosplay costumes. Tactical decisions, humor in the spirit of Dungeon Keeper, and an atmosphere inspired by Heroes III.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</stro